Package: CPR
Type: Package
Title: Cointegrating Polynomial Regressions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CPR-R", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "astadamo18@gmail.com")
Description: Estimation and inference for cointegrating polynomial regressions
    (CPR), following Wagner and co-authors (e.g. Wagner; Wagner & Reichold;
    de Jong & Wagner; Veldhuis & Wagner). Provides fully modified OLS
    (FM-OLS) and dynamic OLS (DOLS) estimators for a single cointegrating
    polynomial regression via cpr(), a panel version via pcpr() (mean-group,
    Pesaran & Smith 1995, and pooled, de Jong & Wagner 2016), a choice of
    kernels and bandwidth selectors for long-run variance estimation, an
    lm()-like formula/data interface for both, CT (KPSS/Shin-type) and PU
    (Phillips-Ouliaris-type) cointegration tests, and turning_points()/
    plot() for EKC-style turning-point analysis of a single or panel fit.
    MOLS and IMOLS remain placeholders for future estimators.
